<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong signs air agreement with Burma.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong signs air agreement with Burma.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong signed an air services agreement with Burma on Tuesday, a government spokesman said.</p>
<p>The agreement will straddle Hong Kong's reversion to China later this year.</p>
<p>The agreement is the 17th signed by Hong Kong which now has accords with the Netherlands, Switzerland, Canada, Brunei. France, New Zealand, Malaysia, Brazil, Sri Lanka, Australia, Germany, South Korea, Singapore, Italy, India and Japan.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6352</p>
</text>
